<title>USA: Vanguard Cellular share buyback approved.</title>
<headline>Vanguard Cellular share buyback approved.</headline>
<dateline>GREENSBORO, N.C. 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vanguard Cellular Systems Inc said on Wednesday its board of directors authorized the repurchase of up to 2.5 million shares of its Class A common stock.</p>
<p>Purchases would be made in the open market or through other transactions, the company said.</p>
<p>Vanguard said its liquidity position enabled it to buy back shares, as well as continue with expansion plans.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
